  "truthBoundary": "A56 validates one bounded out-of-time observation bundle containing at least three independently observed, hash-bound A54 staging evidence runs spread across a minimum 72-hour window, with a frozen source identity, successful compensating restore, metric floors, multiple observer organizations and at least two distinct alternate provider failure domains. It verifies Ed25519 signatures against an externally anchored trust-root file and requires a dual-control aggregate attestation. It does not prove continuous monitoring, production SLO or contractual SLA, production vendor exit, real customer outcomes, unrestricted canary safety, LIVE, production readiness or sale eligibility."
